 slavement\, secession\, Reconstruction and the populist movement. The His
 tory Museum of Mobile hosts the free Learning Lunch series\, and guests a
 re invited to bring their lunch.\nPrice: Free\nArea: Mobile & Baldwin Cou
 nty\nTimes: Wednesday 11/11 · 12:00 PM to 1:00 PM\nChecked against the v
